WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,120
Yes, prophet

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:02,760
This old man can’t figure it out either

3
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:04,560
Even if your door opens inwards

4
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:06,280
It can only ensure that the door can be opened

5
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:07,680
But the snow outside this door

6
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:08,960
why so little

7
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:11,180
Dad, look

8
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:17,700
So that's it

9
00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:19,420
It's that row of fences that blocks the snow

10
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:21,220
Snow fell early on the top of the mountain

11
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:23,260
Naturally, there will be less of them when you come to our place.

12
00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:24,300
This is just one of them

13
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:26,220
A wall of snow behind a fence

14
00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:28,020
It also blocked part of the north wind for us.

15
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:29,980
So the wind that actually hit the igloo last night

16
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:31,140
Much smaller than elsewhere

17
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:33,620
A door and a few broken pieces of wood

18
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:35,500
They all look inconspicuous.

19
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:37,180
It's time to die

20
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:38,500
It actually saves people

21
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:40,220
Lao Zhuang also said that you went to the top of the mountain and fucked you.

22
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:42,580
It's my brain that's frozen, it's better now

23
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:44,740
Their grand door was blocked by snow

24
00:00:44,860 --> 00:00:46,700
Our mouse hole will open as soon as we pull it out

25
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:49,420
The snow over there is buried up to the roof over here.

26
00:00:49,620 --> 00:00:50,780
Haven't even touched the threshold
